  "title": "Suspicious PowerShell Execution with Obfuscation or Download Indicators",
  "id": "9c4e2a7b-5f1d-4c8e-a3b6-7d9f1e2c4a8b",
  "description": "Detects PowerShell processes launched with encoded, hidden-window, or download-cradle command-line arguments commonly used to evade detection or fetch second-stage payloads",
